port creations into STL files for 3D printing.", "short_description": "Zero Art Garden VR enables users to create kinetic sculptures through intuitive hand gestures in a relaxing environment. It offers a seamless blend of technology and creativity.\n\nUser place various blocks into the build area, then those blocks are repeated in a circular pattern that rotates around a larger ring. This app also allows you to export creations into STL files for 3D printing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gameology.space/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gameology Space LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gameology.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7062694370499628"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86627647_804871571762901_1514619305569778436_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D4riHZcjLpQQ7kNvwF0n6UK&_nc_oc=AdmGb0Eigu9v-qMrlrd0frHSJdW5_sUGM9Ek9c6_CDikJu6uv5vy33vBsE6HLrHk_dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyiQ2nz_b12Yw0CV3_FGjw4Jk1Ov9KN3Kx3kVQVP5iAXg&oe=69BD4338"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Zero Art Garden VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "